{"fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T19:04:28.625Z","pushedAt":"2026-10-23T05:42:32Z","branch":"main","issues":1,"watchers":0,"size":23898,"homepage":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Wi4zC5eW3RerVuToagChwQ","archived":false,"files":84,"truncated":false,"readme":{"path":"README.md","html":"<h2 id=\"illustrator\">Illustrator</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/README.md\">简体中文</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/README.en.md\">English</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/docs/readme/real-world-hero.png\" alt=\"使用 Illustrator 制作的真实文章视觉拼图\" /></p>\n<p><strong>让具备代码执行能力的普通 LLM 也能生成设计图片——无需生图模型。</strong></p>\n<p>Illustrator 是一个轻量、无需浏览器的 Agent Skill，通过本地渲染，将自然语言描述、内容、代码和用户提供的图片转化为经过设计的视觉作品。你可以从预制示例开始，也可以完全自由地定义自己的视觉风格。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>项目介绍文章：</strong> <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Wi4zC5eW3RerVuToagChwQ\">查看 Illustrator 的设计思路、使用方式和实际案例</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"为什么选择-illustrator\">为什么选择 Illustrator</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>无需生图模型</strong> — 普通的代码型 LLM 可以通过生成本地渲染代码来创建视觉作品。</li>\n<li><strong>轻量且无需浏览器</strong> — 不依赖 Chromium、Puppeteer 或浏览器运行时。</li>\n<li><strong>预制示例，风格不限</strong> — 可以参考内置示例，也可以使用自己的视觉方向。</li>\n<li><strong>代码驱动、本地渲染</strong> — 视觉作品由生成的渲染代码完成，而不是黑盒生图模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"可以创建什么\">可以创建什么</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>编辑插画与海报</li>\n<li>文章和社交媒体配图</li>\n<li>使用自有图片的照片编排</li>\n<li>数据报告与信息图</li>\n<li>代码片段、代码窗口与 Diff 图片</li>\n<li>完全自定义的视觉系统</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"安装\">安装</h2>\n<p>需要 Node.js 20.19 或更高版本，以及兼容 Agent Skills 的代码 Agent。</p>\n<pre><code>npx skills add Visualizeit/illustrator --skill illustrator\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"使用\">使用</h2>\n<p>安装后，直接向 Agent 描述你想要的视觉作品：</p>\n<pre><code>/illustrator 创建一张 1600×900、主题为专注与深度工作的编辑插画。\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>/illustrator 参考内置的 Flash Diary 示例，重新设计这份内容。\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>/illustrator 把这段代码制作成一张干净、适合演示的图片。\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"真实文章视觉\">真实文章视觉</h2>\n<p>以下是使用 Illustrator 制作并实际发布的文章视觉案例。</p>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/docs/readme/article-series-grid.png\" alt=\"使用 Illustrator 制作的八组文章视觉\" width=\"900\" />\n</p><p>相关文章：<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KUa7gP7OJ3pKIBU96jihrQ\">《不用生图模型，我让 Agent“画”出了这些图》</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"内置示例\">内置示例</h2>\n<p>内置示例同时保留渲染源码、素材和输出预览，方便检查、修改和再次渲染。</p>\n<h3 id=\"插画与编辑视觉\">插画与编辑视觉</h3>\n<h4 id=\"flash-diary\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/flash-diary\">Flash Diary</a></h4>\n<p>以用户图片、醒目字体和精简编辑信息构成的明快城市日记。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/flash-diary\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/flash-diary/preview.png\" alt=\"Flash Diary 示例预览\" width=\"560\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h4 id=\"flower-market\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/flower-market\">Flower Market</a></h4>\n<p>将超大字体与利落的几何花卉结合起来的彩色市集海报。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/flower-market\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/flower-market/preview.png\" alt=\"Flower Market 示例预览\" width=\"560\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h4 id=\"field-archive\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/field-archive\">Field Archive</a></h4>\n<p>以自然形态、测量标注和档案信息构成的当代标本研究视觉。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/field-archive\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/field-archive/preview.png\" alt=\"Field Archive 示例预览\" width=\"560\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h4 id=\"render-specimen\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/render-specimen\">Render Specimen</a></h4>\n<p>将 ILLUSTRATOR 字标转化为带有测量标注和彩色构造层的字体标本。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/render-specimen\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/render-specimen/preview.png\" alt=\"Render Specimen 示例预览\" width=\"900\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h4 id=\"paddock-blue\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/paddock-blue\">Paddock Blue</a></h4>\n<p>将动态摄影与精简性能数据结合起来的克制赛车编辑视觉。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/paddock-blue\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/paddock-blue/preview.png\" alt=\"Paddock Blue 示例预览\" width=\"560\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h4 id=\"grid-operator\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/grid-operator\">Grid Operator</a></h4>\n<p>围绕语义化表格和一次精确交互构建的横版自动化视觉。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/grid-operator\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/grid-operator/preview.png\" alt=\"Grid Operator 示例预览\" width=\"900\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h4 id=\"refraction-atlas\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/refraction-atlas\">Refraction Atlas</a></h4>\n<p>使用清晰对比线和半透明重叠色域构成的分析报告视觉。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/refraction-atlas\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/refraction-atlas/preview.png\" alt=\"Refraction Atlas 示例预览\" width=\"900\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h4 id=\"chromatic-poster\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/chromatic-poster\">Chromatic Poster</a></h4>\n<p>以单一主色域和精简编辑字体构成的极简色彩研究海报。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/chromatic-poster\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/chromatic-poster/preview.png\" alt=\"Chromatic Poster 示例预览\" width=\"560\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h3 id=\"代码图片\">代码图片</h3>\n<h4 id=\"highlights-code-diff\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/highlights-code-diff\">Highlights Code Diff</a></h4>\n<p>适合演示的左右分栏 Diff，包含语法高亮和清晰的增删区域。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/highlights-code-diff\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/highlights-code-diff/preview.png\" alt=\"Highlights Code Diff 示例预览\" width=\"900\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h4 id=\"highlights-code-window\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/highlights-code-window\">Highlights Code Window</a></h4>\n<p>带有精简文件栏和清晰语法高亮的浅色代码窗口。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/highlights-code-window\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/highlights-code-window/preview.png\" alt=\"Highlights Code Window 示例预览\" width=\"900\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h4 id=\"highlights-code-image\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/highlights-code-image\">Highlights Code Image</a></h4>\n<p>适用于文档、文章和社交媒体的极简深色代码图片。</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/examples/highlights-code-image\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/main/skills/illustrator/examples/highlights-code-image/preview.png\" alt=\"Highlights Code Image 示例预览\" width=\"900\" />\n  </a>\n</p><h2 id=\"许可证\">许可证</h2>\n<p>Copyright 2026 Visualizeit。本项目采用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/LICENSE\">Apache License 2.0</a>；再次分发时，必须保留许可证以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/NOTICE\"><code>NOTICE</code></a> 中要求的归属声明。</p>\n<p>仅使用 Illustrator 生成图片时，无需在生成图片上标注 Illustrator。内置字体和示例照片继续遵循各自的许可条款，详见 <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\"><code>THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开发\">开发</h2>\n<p>需要 Node.js 22.18 或更高版本，以及 pnpm。</p>\n<pre><code>pnpm install\npnpm run validate\n</code></pre>\n<p>Skill 源码位于 <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator\"><code>skills/illustrator</code></a>。项目内置 Noto Sans SC 和 JetBrains Mono，以确保文字和代码渲染效果一致；字体和图片来源见 <a href=\"https://github.com/Visualizeit/illustrator/blob/main/skills/illustrator/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\"><code>THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</code></a>。</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>[!IMPORTANT]\n<strong>公开 Alpha 阶段。</strong> Illustrator 目前已经可以使用，但在 v1.0 前，Skill 接口和运行时打包方式仍可能变化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","toc":[{"id":"illustrator","text":"Illustrator","level":2},{"id":"为什么选择-illustrator","text":"为什么选择 Illustrator","level":2},{"id":"可以创建什么","text":"可以创建什么","level":2},{"id":"安装","text":"安装","level":2},{"id":"使用","text":"使用","level":2},{"id":"真实文章视觉","text":"真实文章视觉","level":2},{"id":"内置示例","text":"内置示例","level":2},{"id":"插画与编辑视觉","text":"插画与编辑视觉","level":3},{"id":"代码图片","text":"代码图片","level":3},{"id":"许可证","text":"许可证","level":2},{"id":"开发","text":"开发","level":2}]},"skills":[{"name":"illustrator","description":"Create standalone illustrations, posters, code images, and photo compositions from natural-language direction or supplied content using local rendering code.","path":"skills/illustrator"}],"skillCount":1,"marketplace":false,"plugin":false,"docker":false,"npm":null,"pypi":null,"install":{"skillsAdd":"npx skills add Visualizeit/illustrator --skill illustrator"},"releases":[],"contributors":[{"login":"Visualizeit","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61679509?v=4","n":40}]}
